 "Sparrow is a Bitcoin wallet with a focus on security and usability.": "Sparrow 是一款专注于安全性和易用性的比特币钱包。",
 "Sparrow can operate in both an online and offline mode. In the online mode it connects to a server to display transaction history. In the offline mode it is useful as a transaction editor and as an airgapped multisig coordinator.": "Sparrow 可以同时支持在线和离线模式。在线模式下，它连接到服务器以显示交易历史；离线模式下，它可以作为交易编辑器和离线多签协调工具使用。",
 "Sparrow can operate in both an online and offline mode. In the online mode it connects to a Bitcoin Core node or Electrum server to display transaction history. In the offline mode it is useful as a transaction editor and as an airgapped multisig coordinator.": "Sparrow 可以同时支持在线和离线模式。在线模式下，它连接到 Bitcoin Core 节点或 Electrum 服务器以显示交易历史；离线模式下，它可以作为交易编辑器和离线多签协调工具使用。",
 "Sparrow is a Bitcoin wallet with the goal of providing greater transparency and usability on the path to full financial self-sovereignty. It attempts to provide all of the detail about your wallet setup, transactions and UTXOs so that you can transact with a full understanding of your money.": "Sparrow 是一款比特币钱包，致力于在通往完全金融自主的道路上提供更高的透明度和易用性。它力求提供关于钱包设置、交易和 UTXO 的所有细节，让你在充分了解自己资金的情况下进行交易。",
 "While it's possible to connect to a public Electrum server, connecting Sparrow to your Bitcoin Core node ensures your privacy, while connecting Sparrow to your private Electrum server ensures wallets load quicker, you have access to a full blockchain explorer, and your public keys are always encrypted on disk.": "虽然可以连接到公共 Electrum 服务器，但将 Sparrow 连接到你的 Bitcoin Core 节点可以确保隐私；而将 Sparrow 连接到你的私有 Electrum 服务器可以确保钱包加载更快、可以使用完整的区块链浏览器，并且你的公钥始终在磁盘上加密。",
 "The status bar at the bottom displays the connection status, as demonstrated below:": "底部状态栏显示连接状态，如下所示：",
 "If you are beginning your journey in self custody, or just storing a small amount, the easiest way to connect Sparrow to the Bitcoin blockchain is via one of the preconfigured public Electrum servers. ": "如果你刚刚开始自我保管之旅，或者只存储少量资产，将 Sparrow 连接到比特币区块链的最简单方式是通过其中一个预配置的公共 Electrum 服务器。",
 "However, although Sparrow only connects to servers that have a record of respecting privacy, it is still not ideal as you are sharing your transaction history and balance with them.": "不过，尽管 Sparrow 只连接有尊重隐私记录的服务器，但由于你会与其共享交易历史和余额，这仍然不是理想的方式。",
 "A yellow toggle means you are connected to a public server.": "黄色开关表示你已连接到公共服务器。",
 "If you are running your own Bitcoin Core node, you can configure Sparrow to connect to it directly. ": "如果你运行自己的 Bitcoin Core 节点，可以将 Sparrow 配置为直接连接它。",
 "This means you are not sharing your transaction data, but be aware Bitcoin Core stores your balance, transactions and public keys unencrypted on that node, which is not ideal for true cold storage.": "这意味着你不会共享交易数据，但请注意，Bitcoin Core 会在该节点上以未加密方式存储你的余额、交易和公钥，这对于真正的冷存储来说并不理想。",
 "A green toggle means you are connected to a Bitcoin Core node.": "绿色开关表示你已连接到 Bitcoin Core 节点。",
 "The most private way to connect is to your own Electrum server, which in turn connects to your Bitcoin Core node.": "最私密的连接方式是连接到自己的 Electrum 服务器，而该服务器再连接到你的 Bitcoin Core 节点。",
 "Because these servers index all Bitcoin transactions equally, your wallet transactions are never stored on the server in an identifiable way, and your server forgets your requests immediately after serving them.": "由于这些服务器平等地索引所有比特币交易，你的钱包交易永远不会以可识别的方式存储在服务器上，服务器在提供服务后也会立即忘记你的请求。",
 "A blue toggle means you are connected to a private Electrum server. You're now ready to configure a server and start using Sparrow!": "蓝色开关表示你已连接到私有 Electrum 服务器。你现在可以配置服务器并开始使用 Sparrow 了！",
 "If you find Sparrow useful, consider donating at ": "如果你觉得 Sparrow 有用，请考虑在 ",
 "All external addresses will be connected via this proxy if configured.": "如果配置了代理，所有外部地址都将通过该代理连接。",
 "Allow a wallet to spend UTXOs that are still in the mempool.": "允许钱包花费仍在内存池中的 UTXO。",
 "An external block explorer can be configured to open a transaction from any transaction tab.": "可以配置外部区块浏览器，从任何交易标签页打开交易。",
 "Bitcoin Core RPC onion URLs, and all other non-RPC external addresses will be connected via this proxy if configured.": "如果配置了代理，Bitcoin Core RPC 洋葱地址以及所有其他非 RPC 外部地址都将通过该代理连接。",
 "Change how far ahead to look for additional transactions beyond the highest derivation with previous transaction outputs.": "更改在具有先前交易输出的最高派生之外，继续向前查找额外交易的距离。",
 "Check for updates to Sparrow?": "检查 Sparrow 的更新？",
 "Determines whether to optimize the transaction for low fees or greater privacy": "决定是优化交易以获得低手续费还是更高的隐私性",
 "Disallow keystores to have derivation paths that match the defaults for other script types and networks.": "禁止密钥库使用与其他脚本类型和网络的默认值匹配的派生路径。",
 "Group UTXOs by address when sending to improve privacy by only sending from an address once.": "发送时按地址对 UTXO 分组，通过每个地址只发送一次来提高隐私性。",
 "Keep a record of open wallets, and reopen them on startup.": "记录已打开的钱包，并在启动时重新打开。",
 "Load deep wallets faster by limiting the number of subscriptions to previously used addresses.\nUsed addresses at lower derivation paths will not be checked for new transactions.\nThis setting will take effect in the next wallet load.": "通过限制对已使用地址的订阅数量来更快地加载深层钱包。\n较低派生路径下已使用的地址将不再检查新交易。\n此设置将在下次加载钱包时生效。",
 "Native Segwit the type chosen for most new wallets.\nTaproot is a newer type useful for specific needs.\nNested Segwit and Legacy are useful for recovering older wallets.\nFor existing wallets, be sure to choose the type that matches the wallet you are restoring.": "原生 Segwit 是大多数新钱包选择的类型。\nTaproot 是更新的类型，适用于特定需求。\n嵌套 Segwit 和 Legacy 适用于恢复旧钱包。\n对于现有钱包，请务必选择与你要恢复的钱包匹配的类型。",
 "Recommended fee rates can be sourced from your connected Electrum server, or an external source.": "推荐的费率可以从你连接的 Electrum 服务器或外部来源获取。",
 "Show system notifications on new wallet transactions?": "钱包有新交易时显示系统通知？",
 "Single signature wallets use a single keystore (hardware wallet or seed).\nMultisignature wallets require multiple keystores, of which a certain number need to sign.\nSilent Payments wallets also use a single keystore and can receive privately to a reusable address.": "单签名钱包使用单个密钥库（硬件钱包或助记词）。\n多签钱包需要多个密钥库，其中一定数量的密钥库需要签名。\n静默支付钱包也使用单个密钥库，可以私密地接收到可重复使用的地址。",
 "The date of the earliest transaction (used to avoid scanning the entire blockchain).": "最早交易的日期（用于避免扫描整个区块链）。",
 "The derivation path to the xpub from the master private key.\nFor safety, derivations that match defaults for other script types and networks are not valid.\nThis validation can be turned off in the General Settings.": "从主私钥到扩展公钥的派生路径。\n出于安全考虑，与其他脚本类型和网络的默认值匹配的派生路径无效。\n此验证可以在常规设置中关闭。",
 "The master fingerprint uniquely identifies this keystore using the first 4 bytes of the master public key hash.\nIt is safe to use any valid value (00000000) for Watch Only Wallets.": "主指纹使用主公钥哈希的前 4 个字节来唯一标识此密钥库。\n对于只观察钱包，使用任何有效值（00000000）都是安全的。",
 "Large gap limits may cause wallet loading failures on some servers, or increased rescanning when connected to Bitcoin Core.": "过大的间隔限制可能导致钱包在某些服务器上加载失败，或在连接 Bitcoin Core 时增加重新扫描时间。"
}